{
  "title": "Product Import, Export and Feeds: CSV, Shopify and Google Shopping | CrestApps for Orchard Core",
  "description": "A spreadsheet is the quickest way to fill or change a catalog. CrestApps products import and export as CSV with a column for each product detail, rows are matched by SKU so nothing is added twice, a Shopify or WooCommerce export is read as it is, and product feeds publish your catalog to Google, Meta and TikTok shopping.\n\nIn this video:\n• Why import and feeds, and how they fit together\n• Exporting products with Bulk Export\n• Importing products with Bulk Import: the template, SKUs and skipped rows\n• Product feeds: the feed address, defaults and the Product Feed part\n• Moving from Shopify or WooCommerce",
